                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉ ET DISPOSITIF DE CODAGE, ET PROCÉDÉ ET DISPOSITIF DE DÉCODAGE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">ENCODING METHOD AND DEVICE, AND DECODING METHOD AND DEVICE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A video decoding method includes obtaining split information indicating whether to split a current block, splitting the current block into two or more lower blocks when the split information indicates to split the current block, obtaining encoding order information indicating an encoding order of the lower blocks of the current block, determining a decoding order of the lower blocks according to the encoding order information, and decoding the lower blocks according to the decoding order.</p>
            </abstract>
